NODERAWFS: fstat() on fds 0-2 throws a TypeError

Backport of the libnoderawfs.js change of upstream commit
f4f5003c3452e195ec1967d11a37f7d3a56f2c93 ("Fix fstat on stdio streams under
NODERAWFS"), without its test.

Upstream: https://github.com/emscripten-core/emscripten/issues/27628, fixed by https://github.com/emscripten-core/emscripten/pull/27632
Draft: docs/upstream/emscripten-noderawfs-fstat-stdio.md

